@startuml lock-late
!include style.iuml
skinparam TimingFontSize 11
hide time-axis
scale 1 as 68 pixels

concise "Before: reserve first" as B
robust "Row lock (before)" as BL
concise "After: lock late" as A
robust "Row lock (after)" as AL

BL has Held,Free
AL has Held,Free

@0
B is "checks"
BL is Free
A is "checks"
AL is Free

@1
B is "reserve"
BL is Held
A is "precheck"

@2
B is "order"
A is "order"

@3
B is "items"
A is "items"

@4
B is "cart"
A is "cart"

@5
B is "commit"
A is "reserve"
AL is Held

@6
B is {-}
BL is Free
A is "commit"

@7
A is {-}
AL is Free

BL@1 <-> @6 : held across 4 statements + commit
AL@5 <-> @7 : 1 statement + commit
@enduml
